sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Controller as DSPAReconciler<br/>(controller-manager)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP TLS
    participant APIServer as DS Pipeline API Server<br/>8888/TCP HTTP
    participant OAuthProxy as OAuth Proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS
    participant ArgoWFC as Argo Workflow Controller
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP
    participant MinIO as MinIO<br/>9000/TCP HTTP
    participant MLflow as MLflow CR
    participant KServe as KServe InferenceService

    Note over Controller: Startup: reads OpenShift TLS profile,<br/>configures webhook + metrics TLS

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note over User,Controller: DSPA Reconciliation Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update DSPA CR
        K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (DSPA changed)
        Controller->>Controller: Render Go templates<br/>via manifestival
        Controller->>K8sAPI: Apply owned resources<br/>(Deployments, Services,<br/>Secrets, ConfigMaps, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicies, Routes)
        K8sAPI-->>Controller: Resources created/updated
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
        Note over User,MinIO: Pipeline Execution Flow
        User->>OAuthProxy: POST pipeline request<br/>Auth: OpenShift OAuth
        OAuthProxy->>APIServer: Forward (service-serving cert)
        APIServer->>MariaDB: Store pipeline metadata<br/>(optional pod-to-pod TLS)
        APIServer->>MinIO: Store pipeline artifacts<br/>(HTTP)
        APIServer->>ArgoWFC: Submit Argo Workflow
        ArgoWFC->>K8sAPI: Create Workflow pods
        K8sAPI-->>ArgoWFC: Pod status updates
        ArgoWFC-->>APIServer: Workflow completion
        APIServer-->>OAuthProxy: Pipeline result
        OAuthProxy-->>User: JSON response
    end

    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
        Note over Controller,KServe: External Integration Watches
        Controller->>MLflow: Direct API read<br/>(bypasses cache)
        MLflow-->>Controller: MLflow instance state
        Controller->>KServe: Watch InferenceService
        KServe-->>Controller: Model serving state
    end

    rect rgb(255, 230, 230)
        Note over Webhook,K8sAPI: Webhook Validation Flow
        User->>K8sAPI: Create PipelineVersion CR
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: POST /validate<br/>TLS (OpenShift profile)
        Webhook->>Webhook: Validate PipelineVersion
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admit/Reject
        K8sAPI-->>User: Response
    end
